   "hash": "bf91f15b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.18.1#p1-bf91f15b",
     "text": "That is, the Lord's part of his inheritance.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "inheritance"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.18.3",
   "range": "DEU.18.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2400bbbb",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.18.3#p1-2400bbbb",
     "text": "The right shoulder, Nu 18:18.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "shoulder",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Nu 18:18",
       "ref": "NUM.18.18"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.18.6",
   "range": "DEU.18.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9791e860",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.18.6#p1-9791e860",
     "text": "Meaning, to serve God whole heartedly, and not to seek ease.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "all the desire of his mind"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.18.8",
   "range": "DEU.18.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e4ab3ab4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.18.8#p1-e4ab3ab4",
     "text": "Not forced to live from himself.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "beside that which cometh of the"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.18.10",
   "range": "DEU.18.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "42b40a41",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.18.10#p1-42b40a41",
     "text": "Signifying they were purged by this ceremony of passing between two fires.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "pass through the fire"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.18.13",
   "range": "DEU.18.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "52e2d688",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.18.13#p1-52e2d688",
     "text": "Without hypocrisy or mixture or false religion.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "perfect with the LORD thy God"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.18.15",
   "range": "DEU.18.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "3dbac8e0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.18.15#p1-3dbac8e0",
     "text": "Meaning, a continual succession of prophets, till Christ, the end of all prophets, comes.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "Prophet from the midst of thee"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.18.18",
   "range": "DEU.18.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8b586011",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.18.18#p1-8b586011",
     "text": "A promise not only made to Christ, but to all that teach in his name, Isa 59:21.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "mouth",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Isa 59:21",
       "ref": "ISA.59.21"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.18.19",
   "range": "DEU.18.19",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0225e06c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.18.19#p1-0225e06c",
     "text": "By executing punishment on him.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "require it of him"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/DEU.18.22",
   "range": "DEU.18.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8a7fe07e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/DEU.18.22#p1-8a7fe07e",
     "text": "Under this sure note he comprises all the other tokens.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "follow not"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
